# INVWINMR.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: right clicks on
# the lists with the driver's mouse lines.  A right press on the item
# list's third row selects it, the pop-up opening at its release, and a
# letter's entry acts on that row's item.  A right release alone opens
# nothing; a right double click is a press.  On the split view a right
# click on the contents while the tree has the focus focuses them, the
# pop-up holding their entries.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINMR.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/mousechk.py
# checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
M 208.1 RDOWN ROW 2
S RDOWN
M 208.1 RUP ROW 2
S RPOPUP
K E
S REDIT
K ESC
S REDITBK
M 208.1 RUP ROW 1
S NOPOP
M 208.1 RDBL ROW 1
M 208.1 RUP ROW 1
S RDBLPOP
K E
S RDBLEDIT
K ESC ALT-L B
S LOCS
M 221.1 RDOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 RUP ROW 1
S CPOP
K ESC
S CPOPESC
K ALT-F X
